claim.claim-text:
derive a history-based motion vector prediction, HMVP, candidate list for a current block, wherein the HMVP candidate list comprises an HMVP candidate including motion information of a previous block which is encoded prior to the current block;
derive a motion information candidate list based on the HMVP candidate comprised in the HMVP candidate list, wherein for deriving the motion information candidate list, the HMVP candidate is added in the motion information candidate list;
derive motion information of the current block based on the motion information candidate list;
generate prediction samples for the current block based on the motion information;
derive residual samples based on the prediction samples; and
encode image information comprising information on the residual samples,
wherein more than one tile is present in a current picture,
wherein the current block is for one of coding units, CUs, split from a coding tree unit, CTU,
wherein the HMVP candidate list is updated by adding motion information of a previous block which is encoded prior to the current block as a new HMVP candidate,
wherein for the current picture consisting of 2 tile rows and 2 tile columns, the number of HMVP candidates comprised in the HMVP candidate list is set to zero at a first CTU in a processing order in each CTU row of each tile,
wherein the encoding apparatus further configured to:
